# Design scratch — local only.
# Screenshots, .pen boards, scraped reference and generative sandboxes accumulate at
# the repo root during design passes. They are working material, not artifacts the
# system ships. Every rule is anchored with a leading `/` so real assets inside
# packages/ and apps/ are untouched.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.gif
/*.webp
/*.pen
/*.glsl
/gauge.js
/motto-*
/images/
/sandbox/
/design-team/

# Agent tooling managed outside the repo. .claude/agents and .claude/skills/ds-review
